sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    %% ===== Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (Gateway Mode) =====
    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (Gateway Mode)

    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Gateway (Envoy)<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker (EPP)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MetricsEP as Model Server Metrics<br/>HTTP
    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP
    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc ProcessingRequest<br/>gRPC TLS (request_headers)
    EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, Pod, CRDs<br/>HTTPS, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>EPP: Pool config, pod list, objectives
    EPP->>MetricsEP: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP (50ms polling)
    MetricsEP-->>EPP: queue_depth, kv_cache_usage,<br/>running_requests
    Note over EPP: Run plugin pipeline:<br/>1. Parse request<br/>2. Produce data<br/>3. Filter endpoints<br/>4. Score endpoints<br/>5. Pick best endpoint
    EPP-->>Gateway: ext-proc ProcessingResponse<br/>gRPC TLS (set target_pod header)
    Gateway->>ModelServer: Forward request to<br/>selected pod (HTTP)
    ModelServer-->>Gateway: Inference response
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON / SSE streaming response
    end

    %% ===== Flow 2: Disaggregated P/D Inference (Sidecar Mode) =====
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over ClientPD,DecoderVLLM: Flow 2: Disaggregated P/D Inference (Sidecar Mode)

    participant ClientPD as Client / EPP
    participant Sidecar as pd-sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant PrefillPod as Remote Prefill Pod<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant DecoderVLLM as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8200/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    ClientPD->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (Optional TLS)
    Note over Sidecar: Detect: request needs<br/>prefill routing
    Sidecar->>PrefillPod: Forward prefill request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (Optional TLS)
    Note over PrefillPod,DecoderVLLM: KV-cache transfer via<br/>NIXL / Shared Storage /<br/>SGLang / Mooncake
    PrefillPod-->>Sidecar: Prefill complete +<br/>KV-cache transfer hints
    Sidecar->>DecoderVLLM: Decode request with<br/>KV-cache params (8200/TCP)
    DecoderVLLM-->>Sidecar: Token stream / response
    Sidecar-->>ClientPD: Response (HTTP/HTTPS)
    end

    %% ===== Flow 3: Coordinator Pipeline (E/P/D) =====
    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
    Note over ClientEPD,InfGW: Flow 3: Coordinator Pipeline (E/P/D - upstream only)

    participant ClientEPD as Client
    participant Coordinator as Coordinator<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant RenderSvc as Rendering Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant InfGW as Inference Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP

    ClientEPD->>Coordinator: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP (multimodal input)
    Coordinator->>RenderSvc: Tokenize prompt +<br/>extract features (HTTP)
    RenderSvc-->>Coordinator: Tokens + features
    Coordinator->>InfGW: Dispatch encode stage<br/>HTTP → encode pool
    InfGW-->>Coordinator: Encode result
    Coordinator->>InfGW: Dispatch prefill stage<br/>HTTP → prefill pool
    InfGW-->>Coordinator: Prefill complete
    Coordinator->>InfGW: Dispatch decode stage<br/>HTTP → decode pool
    InfGW-->>Coordinator: Token stream
    Coordinator-->>ClientEPD: SSE streaming response<br/>HTTP
    end
